'''Chroma Luger''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a color alternating luger pistol, hence the name. However, the toggle pin and the grip of the handle are slightly darker in color.

== Trivia ==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Luger]], which can be found in the same box.
*It is the most valued out of all Lugers.
*It is one of the five Luger reskins, the others being [[Red Luger]], [[Green Luger]], [[Ginger Luger]], and [[Lugercane]].
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it was a victim of [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|the Duping Glitch (2021)]].
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/95354288/Luger-Pistol Luger Pistol], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux. However, it was retextured, altering it from a black shade to a color-alternating texture.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

